      "body": "The JSON-Editor for `new orders` and `edit orders` shows the template name at the top of the form.\r\n\r\nThe template name is computer generated. We shouldn't show it.  Either remove the label, or introduce a prop to tell `json-editor` not to display the template title.\r\n\r\nNote: this also relates to the rehearsal feedback regarding \"info ops not cyber template\".\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1108513/218983857-b455577b-628b-4bf4-9e43-d0a964932562.png)\r\n\r\n",
